Package: trashwheelexplorer
Title: Delve into Baltimore's Trash Wheel Collection Patterns
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Caryn", "Kesuma",
    email = "kesuma.caryn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a organised data set of rubbish collected by
  Baltimore's Trash Wheels, a function for summarising estimated
  rubbish counts, and an interactive Shiny app for exploring
  collection patterns across locations and years.
